telcosec-cli (3.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Multi-platform Darwin (macOS Apple Silicon & Intel) release binaries.
  * Official Homebrew tap formula integration (telcosec-tools/tap).
  * Multi-architecture container automation (ghcr.io/telcosec-tools/telcosec-cli).
  * Automated release bumping and unattended GPG package signing.

