telcosec-cli (3.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial standalone release of telcosec-cli.
  * Zero-dependency Go implementation with telemetry, sdr, network,
    cellular, search, and docs packages.
  * Embedded shell autocompletion suite for Bash, Zsh, and Fish.
  * Linux Section 1 manual page (telcosec.1 / telcochisel.1).

